# What never goes into the website's build context (and so never into an image layer). See ADR-0081 and ADR-0082.
# Secrets: .env.local holds this machine's keys. They reach a container only as environment variables at start.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
# Rebuilt inside the image, or only for this machine.
**/node_modules
.next
out
test-results
playwright-report
e2e
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
